Install and update (Windows)
----------------------------
Keep this folder together: the setup program copies game_files\ from the
folder it runs in. Run Burnout3Takedown-@VERSION@-setup.exe. It installs
for your user only (no administrator rights) to
%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Burnout3Takedown and adds a Start Menu entry.
Running a newer setup installs on top and keeps your saves. Uninstall from
Settings > Apps; your saves and settings stay in
%LOCALAPPDATA%\Burnout3Takedown.

Windows may warn before running the setup program or Burnout3Takedown.exe:
they are built on your machine and not signed. SmartScreen: "More info" >
"Run anyway". If the folder came as a .zip downloaded or copied from
another machine, right-click the .zip > Properties > Unblock before
extracting (Mark of the Web), or Windows asks again for every file.

Note: this build is tested under Proton on Linux only, not on native
Windows.

Controls
--------
Two controllers work, as players 1 and 2 (XInput pads 1 and 2). There is no
keyboard: the game's menus and races read only the pad.

Speed
-----
The game steps a fixed amount per frame. On a machine that cannot keep up,
races play in slow motion but correctly.
